### Test 1: Get Members - Units
POST {{baseUrl}}/Group/getMembers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 15,
  "entityType": "units"
}

### Test 2: Get Members - Available units
POST {{baseUrl}}/Group/getMembers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 15,
  "entityType": "units",
  "available": true
}

### Test 3: Get Members - Invalid (entity type)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Group/getMembers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 15,
  "entityType": "trucks"
}
